          "heading": "Fiji fall to bottom of tournament table following three successive defeats",
          "body": "Fiji sit bottom of the tournament table following three consecutive defeats. The team have struggled for form, scoring just 49 points in their three matches. Defensively, they have leaked 145 points over the same period. Their latest setback was a 17-33 loss against Scotland in the third round. This run of form is a far cry from 2023, when the side reached their highest ever world ranking of No. 7."
