          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Sam Underhill undergoes bicep surgery to miss England's Nations Championship campaign",
          "body": "England flanker Sam Underhill will miss November's Nations Championship Tests after Bath confirmed he requires surgery on a ruptured bicep. The 30-year-old was forced off 48 minutes into his comeback appearance against Harlequins last Friday. Bath head of rugby Johann van Graan confirmed the diagnosis, stating Underhill will undergo surgery on Thursday and face \"a few months\" on the sidelines. It is a major blow for Steve Borthwick's side, especially after Underhill missed the July tour with a shoulder issue."
        },
