          "kicker": "Tournament reform",
          "heading": "Yann Roubert backs proposal to reduce Champions Cup to 16 teams",
          "body": "Yann Roubert has endorsed a proposed overhaul of the Investec Champions Cup, supporting a reduction from 24 teams to 16. The plan, reportedly driven by English clubs, would see the French Top 14 provide five or six representatives in a bid to prioritise \"very high-level matches.\" Roubert also noted that the long-term participation of South African sides remains a point for discussion, acknowledging that no South African club has yet progressed beyond the quarter-final stage of the tournament."
