          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Casey and Loughman return for Munster as Leinster lose Deegan to concussion",
          "body": "Munster have been bolstered by the return of Ireland internationals Craig Casey and Jeremy Loughman ahead of their weekend clash with the Bulls. The pair are back in contention following their mandatory IRFU rest period after the July tour. Conversely, Leinster coach Leo Cullen will be without fly-half Harry Byrne and back-rower Max Deegan for the Sharks match due to concussion. They join a lengthy injury list that includes Caelan Doris and Jamison Gibson-Park as the province prepares for its trip to Durban."
