          "kicker": "Player movement",
          "heading": "Uruguayan flanker Lucas Bianchi completes move to Italian side Viadana",
          "body": "Uruguay international Lucas Bianchi has secured a move to Serie A Elite side Viadana. The 25-year-old flanker, who represented Los Teros at the 2023 Rugby World Cup, arrives with 29 test caps of experience. Having previously featured for Peñarol and captained the Uruguay XV, Bianchi is one of several South American players seeking professional contracts in Europe as the build-up to the 2027 Rugby World Cup intensifies. His arrival bolsters the domestic competition ahead of the new season."
