          "heading": "Craig Dods departs Scottish Rugby to lead Canada sevens programme",
          "body": "Galashiels-born Craig Dods has been appointed as the new head coach of Canada’s men’s sevens team. Dods, who previously served as a specialist skills coach with Scottish Rugby and as an assistant coach for the British sevens setup, will also act as an assistant to head coach Stephen Meehan for the Canadian 15s squad. He takes on the role with the aim of guiding the men’s sevens programme toward qualification for the 2028 Los Angeles Olympic Games."
